    Your estimated rewards: 324 dollars per year.
   </div> 
   <div class="top" aria-hidden="true"> 
    <p class="banner-body-copy">Your estimated rewards:</p> 
    <p class="banner-total-cash-back"><span class="dollar-icon">$</span><span class="total-cash-back">324</span></p> 
    <p class="banner-body-copy"><span class="link-color">per year<sup data-fragment-ref="/content/dam/disclaimers/simplii/offers/cash-back-estimate" data-footnote-type="symbolic" data-fragment-variation="master" class="termsandconditions-footnote" style="padding-top: 45px; margin-top: -45px;"><a href="#fn_s2" class="termsandconditions-footnote-link footnote-symbolic fn-lnk" aria-label="double dagger symbol (footnote)" style="" id="fn_s2-1-rf">‡</a></sup></span></p> 
