                <ul> 
 <li>Your minimum household annual income is $15,000</li> 
 <li>You live in Canada and you’re a Canadian citizen or permanent resident (excluding Quebec)</li> 
 <li>You've reached the age of majority in your province or territory</li> 
 <li>You haven't declared bankruptcy in the last 7 years</li> 
</ul>
            
            
            
            
        </div>
    


    
